{"suttaId":"thag3.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1185,1194],"vripara":"231"},"segments":{"thag3.5:0.4":"Mātaṅgaputtattheragāthā","thag3.5:1.1":"“Atisītaṃ atiuṇhaṃ, atisāyamidaṃ ahu;","thag3.5:1.3":"Iti vissaṭṭhakammante, khaṇā accenti māṇave.","thag3.5:2.1":"“Yo ca sītañca uṇhañca, tiṇā bhiyyo na maññati;","thag3.5:2.3":"Karaṃ purisakiccāni, so sukhā na vihāyati.","thag3.5:3.1":"“Dabbaṃ kusaṃ poṭakilaṃ, usīraṃ muñjapabbajaṃ;","thag3.5:3.3":"Urasā panudissāmi, vivekamanubrūhayan”ti.","thag3.5:3.5":"… Mātaṅgaputto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
